            {
                "entry_id": "4d8cba55-01e3-3e9d-990e-e20437e23ddd",
                "word": "ag",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4b98a71a-826c-3050-9ee9-ff61caa99ef7",
                        "entry_id": "4d8cba55-01e3-3e9d-990e-e20437e23ddd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expressing annoyance, remorse, surprise etc.; oh, ah."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "South-Africa"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d7d1d6d-02d2-47a3-adb0-166841341e5d",
                                "sense_id": "4b98a71a-826c-3050-9ee9-ff61caa99ef7",
                                "text": "Ag pleez Deddy won't you take us to the wrestling / We wanna see an ou called Sky High Lee"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d4b8c2e2-4400-4c9a-8c79-ffc8782f0fd5",
                                "sense_id": "4b98a71a-826c-3050-9ee9-ff61caa99ef7",
                                "text": "‘Ag, fuck it,’ he said. ‘Let bygones be bygones, man.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84872c88-88f5-4ed2-8944-4ded2b6cc682",
                                "sense_id": "4b98a71a-826c-3050-9ee9-ff61caa99ef7",
                                "text": "Finally, after placing four books on the desk, he turned to a sheepish Kathy and said, ‘Ag, there's nothing wrong with these desks,’ and walked out."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "0bea495c-83b6-3d98-8454-4ed8adb86a1b",
                "word": "AG",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "911cf635-0a3e-3cdc-82d2-af63551f03a6",
                        "entry_id": "0bea495c-83b6-3d98-8454-4ed8adb86a1b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of American Girl."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "04736829-f5ed-4926-aebd-2557723fc186",
                                "sense_id": "911cf635-0a3e-3cdc-82d2-af63551f03a6",
                                "text": "Triggered by the AG collection of dolls, books, and accessories, this cultural phenomenon is changing the way girls conceptualize America and themselves"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e68c3098-b8b0-48bf-9de1-5c2d82d92b09",
                                "sense_id": "911cf635-0a3e-3cdc-82d2-af63551f03a6",
                                "text": "There are more than eighty thousand different kinds of American Girl Doll videos on YouTube. A smattering are just AG enthusiasts showing off their collections."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "96697aca-d358-438b-921d-851b89d546ee",
                                "sense_id": "911cf635-0a3e-3cdc-82d2-af63551f03a6",
                                "text": "When it comes down to everything, I really think AG does not represent the Black community, and they do not represent the queer community."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
